CASPRIX COMPILER - VERSION 1.0.0 👻
================================

Release Status: Production
Release Date:   December 29, 2025
Target Arch:    x86-64 (Windows, Linux, macOS)

CHANGELOG
=========

Version 1.0.0 (2025-12-29)
--------------------------

Core Features:
* Full Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) implementation
  - Classes with explicit constructors
  - Access modifiers: public, private, protected
  - Static member fields and methods
  - Robust encapsulation model
* Optimized x86-64 Calling Convention (Windows)
  - Standardized shadow space allocation
  - Corrected stack parameter offsets for 5+ arguments
  - Optimized callee-saved register management (R15)
* Enhanced Assembly Generation
  - Precise constructor parameter resolution
  - Object pointer preservation across method calls
* Standard Library Modules
  - Optimized Collections: List, Map, Queue, Stack
  - Math and String operation suites

Bug Fixes:
* Resolved stack corruption in high-arity method calls
* Fixed R15-based constructor argument passing regressions
* Corrected member access resolution for nested method calls

Known Limitations:
* String type is currently identity-based (integrated roadmap for v1.1.0)
* Collections getSize() integrity issues under specific edge cases
* Experimental inheritance support (Super/Subclass keywords pending)

